WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.950
JavaScript flips a class, and CSS changes the look

2
00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:09.030
CSS decides what the dark look is. It is only a class.

3
00:00:10.029 --> 00:00:14.929
The script just adds or removes the class. Toggle does whichever is needed.

4
00:00:19.159 --> 00:00:23.709
One click added the class dark to the body, and the CSS did the rest.

5
00:00:26.291 --> 00:00:30.391
Another click removed it. In class List, the name has no dot.
